msgstr "``vllm>=0.22.0``, ``transformers>=5.8.0``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/speculative_decoding.rst:61
msgid ""
"Translated into ``speculative_config`` with ``method: mtp``. An explicitly "
"provided ``speculative_config`` is left untouched. Older vLLM treats the "
"drafter as a generic draft model, while older Transformers does not "
"recognize ``gemma4_assistant``; either case is rejected before engine "
"initialization. Virtual-environment launches also synchronize ``flashinfer-"
"cubin`` with ``flashinfer-python`` before starting vLLM, repairing stale "
"environments that contain mismatched FlashInfer packages."
msgstr ""
"``method: mtp`` の ``speculative_config`` に変換します。明示的な ``speculative_config`` "
"は維持します。古い vLLM は一般のドラフトとして扱い、古い Transformers は ``gemma4_assistant`` "
"を認識しないため、どちらも初期化前に拒否します。仮想環境では vLLM 起動前に ``flashinfer-cubin`` と "
"``flashinfer-python`` を同期し、不一致の FlashInfer パッケージを修復します。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/speculative_decoding.rst:69
msgid ":ref:`SGLang <sglang_backend>`"
msgstr ":ref:`SGLang <sglang_backend>`"

